@{
    Layout = null;
}

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>1과 | 성경적 세계관이 뭐예요?</title>

    <!-- 폰트(선택): 시스템 폰트 중심 + 살짝 둥근 느낌 -->
    <style>
        :root {
            --paper: #fbfbfd;
            --grid: rgba(46, 58, 89, .08);
            --ink: #1c2430;
            --muted: #5c6b7a;
            --purple: #6b4ea2;
            --purple2: #8a76c9;
            --sky: #d7ecff;
            --sky2: #bfe0ff;
            --navy: #3c4f6a;
            --band: #4d6b8f;
            --pink: #ffd8e6;
            --pink2: #ffb9d2;
            --mint: #dff7ec;
            --mint2: #bfead7;
            --sand: #fff0cf;
            --sand2: #ffe2a3;
            --line: #d9dfe8;
            --card: #ffffffcc;
            --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(20,25,40,.12);
            --radius: 22px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", "Malgun Gothic", Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 20% 0%, #f0f7ff 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 10%, #fff0f7 0%, transparent 55%), radial-gradient(900px 700px at 10% 95%, #effff7 0%, transparent 50%), var(--paper);
        }

        /* 종이 그리드 배경 */
        .paper {
            max-width: 980px;
            margin: 22px auto;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 26px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            background: linear-gradient(0deg, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/24px 24px, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/24px 24px, rgba(255,255,255,.86);
            border: 1px solid rgba(20,30,60,.08);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* 상단 헤더 */
        .header {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 170px 1fr 140px;
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .lesson-cloud {
            position: relative;
            width: 170px;
            height: 92px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f3f7ff 100%);
            border: 2px solid rgba(90,110,170,.18);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(30,55,90,.12);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-left: 42px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

            .lesson-cloud:before, .lesson-cloud:after {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f3f7ff 100%);
                border: 2px solid rgba(90,110,170,.16);
                border-radius: 999px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(30,55,90,.08);
            }

            .lesson-cloud:before {
                width: 88px;
                height: 64px;
                left: -18px;
                top: 26px;
            }

            .lesson-cloud:after {
                width: 68px;
                height: 52px;
                left: 18px;
                top: -12px;
            }

        .lesson-num {
            position: absolute;
            left: 18px;
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #6a5aa8;
            text-shadow: 0 10px 18px rgba(60,40,120,.18);
        }

        .lesson-text {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #3b3b55;
            letter-spacing: -.2px;
            margin-left: 6px;
        }

        .title-wrap {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .unit {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: clamp(22px, 3.4vw, 36px);
            font-weight: 950;
            letter-spacing: -0.8px;
            color: #4d3e73;
            text-shadow: 0 12px 18px rgba(70,50,120,.12);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .qr-mini {
            justify-self: end;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

            .qr-mini .badge {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #6b7a8a;
                font-weight: 800;
                background: #eef3ff;
                border: 1px solid rgba(80,110,160,.18);
                padding: 6px 10px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

        .qr {
            width: 76px;
            height: 76px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(20,30,50,.18);
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,.08) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/8px 8px, linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.08) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/8px 8px, #fff;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

            .qr:before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                inset: 10px;
                background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #000 0 6px, transparent 7px), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, #000 0 6px, transparent 7px), radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, #000 0 6px, transparent 7px), radial-gradient(circle at 60% 60%, #000 0 2px, transparent 3px), radial-gradient(circle at 40% 50%, #000 0 2px, transparent 3px), radial-gradient(circle at 55% 35%, #000 0 2px, transparent 3px), radial-gradient(circle at 72% 68%, #000 0 2px, transparent 3px);
                opacity: .9;
                border-radius: 10px;
            }

        /* 말씀 띠 */
        .verse-band {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5b6f91 0%, #3f5d86 60%, #2f4a70 100%);
            color: #f4f7ff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(30,55,90,.18);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .verse-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -.2px;
        }

        .verse-pill {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
            padding: 7px 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 900;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .verse-verse {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 240px;
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: .95;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        /* 핵심 문장(말씀 안경) */
        .definition {
            margin-top: 14px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border: 2px solid rgba(110,130,170,.22);
            background: rgba(245,248,255,.72);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 26px rgba(40,60,100,.10);
            padding: 18px 16px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .glasses {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

            .glasses .icon {
                width: 92px;
                height: 92px;
                border-radius: 26px;
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #f4f1ff 100%);
                border: 2px solid rgba(120,90,180,.18);
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                font-size: 42px;
                box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(90,70,140,.14);
            }

            .glasses .label {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #546173;
                font-weight: 900;
                letter-spacing: -.2px;
            }

        .def-text {
            font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 20px);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -.4px;
            color: #2f2f44;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        /* 빈칸 박스 */
        .blank {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transform: translateY(2px);
            margin: 0 4px;
        }

        .box {
            width: 34px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(60,70,95,.26);
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 18px rgba(20,25,40,.08);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-weight: 950;
            color: #334155;
        }

        /* 2개 영역(가족/소금과빛) */
        .grid2 {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .panel {
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border: 2px solid rgba(90,110,150,.16);
            background: var(--card);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(20,25,40,.10);
            padding: 14px 14px 12px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

            .panel:before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                inset: -80px -120px auto auto;
                width: 260px;
                height: 260px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                opacity: .55;
                filter: blur(0px);
            }

            .panel.pink:before {
                background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--pink2), transparent 60%);
            }

            .panel.blue:before {
                background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--sky2), transparent 60%);
            }

        .panel-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 950;
            letter-spacing: -.3px;
            color: #3a3a55;
        }

            .panel-title .sticker {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
                border-radius: 16px;
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                font-size: 22px;
                border: 2px solid rgba(30,40,60,.12);
                box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(20,25,40,.10);
                background: #fff;
            }

        .pink .panel-title .sticker {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #fff0f6 100%);
        }

        .blue .panel-title .sticker {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #eef7ff 100%);
        }

        .panel ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 18px;
            color: #394454;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .say-box {
            margin-top: 10px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border: 1px dashed rgba(150,90,120,.35);
            background: rgba(255, 233, 243, .55);
        }

            .say-box .cap {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #6a5863;
                font-weight: 900;
                margin-bottom: 6px;
            }

        .say {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #3a2f36;
            font-weight: 850;
        }

            .say small {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 6px;
                color: #6a5863;
                font-weight: 800;
            }

        .qr-big {
            margin-top: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

            .qr-big .qr {
                width: 120px;
                height: 120px;
                border-radius: 16px;
            }

            .qr-big .hint {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #5f6f80;
                font-weight: 900;
            }

        /* 기도하기 */
        .prayer {
            margin-top: 14px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border: 2px solid rgba(90,120,110,.18);
            background: rgba(226, 252, 238, .62);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(20,25,40,.10);
            padding: 16px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

            .prayer:before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                width: 320px;
                height: 320px;
                right: -140px;
                bottom: -170px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--mint2), transparent 60%);
                opacity: .65;
            }

        .prayer-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 950;
            color: #2e5141;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: -.2px;
        }

            .prayer-head .sticker {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
                border-radius: 16px;
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                font-size: 22px;
                border: 2px solid rgba(40,80,60,.14);
                box-shadow: 0 14px 22px rgba(20,25,40,.10);
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #f0fff7 100%);
                z-index: 1;
            }

        .prayer-text {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            margin: 0;
            white-space: pre-line;
            font-weight: 850;
            color: #2d3d36;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* 미션 완료 스탬프 */
        .mission {
            position: absolute;
            right: 14px;
            bottom: 14px;
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--sand2), var(--sand) 55%, #ffd27a 100%);
            border: 2px solid rgba(140,110,40,.22);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(40,30,10,.18);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            transform: rotate(-8deg);
            z-index: 2;
        }

            .mission .t {
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 950;
                color: #6a4b00;
                letter-spacing: -.3px;
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.1;
            }

            .mission input {
                margin-top: 8px;
                width: 22px;
                height: 22px;
                accent-color: #b7791f;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

        /* 하단 미세 텍스트 */
        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            color: rgba(80,90,110,.65);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* 반응형 */
        @@media (max-width: 860px) {
            .header

        {
            grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
            grid-template-areas:
                "cloud qr"
                "title title";
        }

        .lesson-cloud {
            grid-area: cloud;
        }

        .qr-mini {
            grid-area: qr;
        }

        .title-wrap {
            grid-area: title;
            text-align: left;
            padding-left: 6px;
        }

        .definition {
            grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
        }

        }
        @@media (max-width: 720px) {
            .grid2

        {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .definition {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .glasses {
            flex-direction: row;
            justify-content: flex-start;
        }

            .glasses .icon {
                width: 72px;
                height: 72px;
                border-radius: 20px;
                font-size: 34px;
            }

        .mission {
            width: 96px;
            height: 96px;
        }

        }
        @@media (max-width: 420px) {
            .lesson-cloud

        {
            width: 155px;
            height: 86px;
        }

        .lesson-num {
            font-size: 44px;
        }

        .verse-band {
            border-radius: 22px;
        }

        .box {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
        }

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="paper" role="main" aria-label="성경적 세계관 웹카드">
        <!-- HEADER -->
        <section class="header">
            <div class="lesson-cloud" aria-label="1과">
                <div class="lesson-num">1</div>
                <div class="lesson-text">과</div>
            </div>

            <div class="title-wrap">
                <div class="unit">1단원 하나님 나라 백성의 세계관</div>
                <h1 class="title">성경적 세계관이 뭐예요?</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="qr-mini" aria-label="성경이야기 QR">
                <div class="qr" title="QR (샘플)"></div>
                <div class="badge">성경이야기</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- VERSE BAND -->
        <section class="verse-band" aria-label="외울 말씀">
            <div class="verse-left">
                <span class="verse-pill">히브리서 11장 1–3절</span>
                <span class="verse-pill">외울 말씀</span>
            </div>
            <div class="verse-verse">
                믿음으로 모든 세계가 하나님의 말씀으로 지어진 줄을 우리가 아나니
                보이는 것은 나타난 것으로 말미암아 된 것이 아니니라 (히브리서 11:3)
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- DEFINITION -->
        <section class="definition" aria-label="성경적 세계관 정의">
            <div class="glasses">
                <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">👓</div>
                <div class="label">말씀 안경</div>
            </div>

            <div class="def-text">
                성경적 세계관은
                <span class="blank" aria-label="첫 번째 빈칸">
                    <span class="box">말</span><span class="box">씀</span>
                </span>
                대로 세상을
                <span class="blank" aria-label="두 번째 빈칸">
                    <span class="box">보</span><span class="box">고</span>
                </span>,
                <span class="blank" aria-label="세 번째 빈칸">
                    <span class="box">생</span><span class="box">각</span>
                </span>
                하고,
                <span class="blank" aria-label="네 번째 빈칸">
                    <span class="box">행</span><span class="box">동</span>
                </span>
                하는 거예요.
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TWO PANELS -->
        <section class="grid2" aria-label="활동 영역">
            <!-- FAMILY -->
            <article class="panel pink" aria-label="가족과 이야기해요">
                <div class="panel-title">
                    <div class="sticker" aria-hidden="true">🏠</div>
                    <div>가족과 이야기해요</div>
                </div>

                <ul>
                    <li>말씀 안경은 어떻게 쓸 수 있을까요?</li>
                    <li>눈에 보이지 않지만 믿음으로 본 것이 있나요?</li>
                    <li>안아주면서 축복의 말을 해요.</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="say-box" role="note" aria-label="축복 문장 예시">
                    <div class="cap">함께 말해요</div>
                    <div class="say">
                        “○○○야, 말씀대로 생각하고 행동하기를 축복해.”
                        <small>“성경 말씀을 따라 생각하고 행동할게요.”</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- SALT & LIGHT -->
            <article class="panel blue" aria-label="소금과 빛">
                <div class="panel-title">
                    <div class="sticker" aria-hidden="true">✨</div>
                    <div>소금과 빛</div>
                </div>

                <ul>
                    <li>&lt;성경적 세계관 살아가기&gt; 시간에 만든 말씀 안경의 글씨를 읽어요.</li>
                    <li>1단원송 찬양을 불러요.</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="qr-big" aria-label="활동 QR">
                    <div class="qr" title="QR (샘플)"></div>
                    <div class="hint">여기에 실제 QR 이미지로 교체해도 좋아요</div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </section>

        <!-- PRAYER -->
        <section class="prayer" aria-label="기도하기">
            <div class="prayer-head">
                <div class="sticker" aria-hidden="true">🙏</div>
                <div>기도하기</div>
            </div>

            <p class="prayer-text">
                하나님 아버지!
                성경적 세계관을 배우게 해주셔서 감사해요.
                저에게 믿음을 주세요.
                그래서 말씀대로 세상을 보게 해주세요.
                말씀대로 생각하고 행동하게 도와주세요.
                예수님의 이름으로 기도합니다. 아멘.
            </p>

            <div class="mission" aria-label="미션 완료 체크">
                <div class="t">미션 완료</div>
                <input type="checkbox" aria-label="미션 완료 체크박스" />
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="footer-note">
        
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
